    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Bluetooth is a wireless radio "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "technology",
            "zh": "无线电技术"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". We can "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "link",
            "ref": "v-link"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " our phones and computers by using it. But do you know how Bluetooth got its name and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "logo",
            "ref": "v-logo"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "History of Bluetooth and its name"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The name Bluetooth comes from the second "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "king",
            "ref": "v-king"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Denmark",
            "zh": "丹麦"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the 10th "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "century",
            "ref": "v-century"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". His real name was Harald Gormsson."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It’s said that the king liked eating "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "blueberries",
            "ref": "v-blueberry"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " so much that his teeth became blue. And that was how he got his "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "nickname",
            "ref": "v-nickname"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—Bluetooth!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Just as the king brought warring parties together, Bluetooth technology brings different "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "devices",
            "ref": "v-device"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " together."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Story of Bluetooth’s logo"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The logo of Bluetooth also comes from King Harald Bluetooth. It’s a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "combination",
            "zh": "结合体"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of his "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "initials",
            "zh": "名字的首字母"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Scandinavian* runes*: H and B. When you join the two and put it on a blue "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "background",
            "ref": "v-background"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", you get the logo!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "note",
        "title": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Did you know?"
          }
        ],
        "content": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "* Scandinavian在这里是形容词，意为“斯堪的纳维亚的”。斯堪的纳维亚（Scandinavia）为北欧的一个地区，包括挪威、瑞典和丹麦，有时还包括冰岛、法罗群岛和芬兰。"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "* 如尼字母（runes）属于北欧古文字体系。"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
